    "name": "Blood Sword",
    "steam_appid": 3645170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developers of <i>Fabled Lands</i>, comes a new adaptation of a beloved gamebook series \u2014 darker, deadlier, and more tactical than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of <i>Blood Sword</i>, a tactical role-playing game that brings the cult-classic gamebooks by Dave Morris and Oliver Johnson to life in a richly atmospheric, narrative-driven experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645170/extras/cb22d26ca8026c9052408be6573a705e.avif?t=1752489220\" width=800 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a party of heroes through a deadly campaign across a war-torn realm steeped in dark magic, ancient secrets, and fate-bound prophecy. Whether you play as a cunning rogue, a battle-hardened warrior, a pious mystic, or a fire-wielding mage, <i>Blood Sword</i> lets you craft your build, choose your path, and confront your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Tactical, Party-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to four unique heroes in grid-based turn-based battles. Use positioning, powerful abilities, and synergistic tactics to overcome brutal enemies \u2014 from undead cultists to demonic entities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>A Story Rich in Lore and Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the original gamebooks, <i>Blood Sword</i> offers a branching narrative with branching choices, moral decisions, and exploration that can lead to alternate outcomes \u2014 including character deaths and new story paths. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645170/extras/99b4b96d5cbeb61fe8d0108eb816ccdb.avif?t=1752489220\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Build Your Heroes, Master Your Class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from diverse skill trees and disciplines. Mix classes and spells to shape your party\u2019s strengths \u2014 whether through brute force, subtle magic, divine favor, or underhanded tricks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Permadeath, High Stakes, and Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice can cost you \u2014 your party members can fall in battle, and consequences echo throughout the campaign. Your triumphs and failures both become part of your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645170/extras/650722e4da63845e991e8c9ce05e1eab.avif?t=1752489220\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Explore a Grim Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse detailed maps, investigate story notes, and uncover ancient secrets across cities, dungeons, wastelands, and ruins. Your journey is non-linear \u2014 and shaped by your decisions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developers of <i>Fabled Lands</i>, comes a new adaptation of a beloved gamebook series \u2014 darker, deadlier, and more tactical than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of <i>Blood Sword</i>, a tactical role-playing game that brings the cult-classic gamebooks by Dave Morris and Oliver Johnson to life in a richly atmospheric, narrative-driven experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645170/extras/cb22d26ca8026c9052408be6573a705e.avif?t=1752489220\" width=800 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a party of heroes through a deadly campaign across a war-torn realm steeped in dark magic, ancient secrets, and fate-bound prophecy. Whether you play as a cunning rogue, a battle-hardened warrior, a pious mystic, or a fire-wielding mage, <i>Blood Sword</i> lets you craft your build, choose your path, and confront your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Tactical, Party-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to four unique heroes in grid-based turn-based battles. Use positioning, powerful abilities, and synergistic tactics to overcome brutal enemies \u2014 from undead cultists to demonic entities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>A Story Rich in Lore and Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the original gamebooks, <i>Blood Sword</i> offers a branching narrative with branching choices, moral decisions, and exploration that can lead to alternate outcomes \u2014 including character deaths and new story paths. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645170/extras/99b4b96d5cbeb61fe8d0108eb816ccdb.avif?t=1752489220\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Build Your Heroes, Master Your Class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from diverse skill trees and disciplines. Mix classes and spells to shape your party\u2019s strengths \u2014 whether through brute force, subtle magic, divine favor, or underhanded tricks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Permadeath, High Stakes, and Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice can cost you \u2014 your party members can fall in battle, and consequences echo throughout the campaign. Your triumphs and failures both become part of your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645170/extras/650722e4da63845e991e8c9ce05e1eab.avif?t=1752489220\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Explore a Grim Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse detailed maps, investigate story notes, and uncover ancient secrets across cities, dungeons, wastelands, and ruins. Your journey is non-linear \u2014 and shaped by your decisions.</p>",
    "short_description": "An ancient evil returns. A sword lost to legend. A party bound by fate. Forge your legacy in a story-rich RPG of turn-based combat and branching choices, inspired by the classic Blood Sword saga.",
